## Problem classes

### `Global skill missing in Cursor`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `/grill-me` not in `/` picker | Install landed in `~/.agents/skills` only, or `~/.cursor/skills` never created | Symlink each pack skill into `~/.cursor/skills/<name>`; do not use skills-cursor |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `Build loop vs published pack confusion`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Editing `.cursor/skills/task-1-plan` does not change the global `/task-1-plan` | Those are different trees | Edit `skills/task-1-plan` for the pack; `.cursor/skills` is Superplan's own loop |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->
